  "content": "\n\n<h1>附魔提取書</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fenchantment-extraction-book\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchantment-extraction-book?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權\"></a></p>\n<p>從武器、工具和盔甲中提取附魔，且不會損壞原物品！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🔥 使用方法</h2>\n<p>主手持有<code>附魔提取書</code>，副手持有附魔物品時，使用右鍵點擊。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🛠️ 合成配方</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Exi1NMB.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題回報</h2>\n<p>如有任何錯誤或問題，請前往 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 進行回報。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>獲取：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot enchantment_extraction_book:book</code></pre>\n<p>停用：</p>\n<pre><code>/datapack disable \"file/enchantment-extraction-book.zip\"</code></pre>\n<p>啟用：</p>\n<pre><code>/datapack enable \"file/enchantment-extraction-book.zip\"</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantment-extraction-book-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，只需點擊幾下就能擁有自己的伺服器！他們提供全天候客服與快速回應，絕不會讓問題阻礙你的腳步！有興趣嗎？我們為你準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b